ed container width"],[242,"**VisX integration**: Leverages VisX primitives for scales, axes, shapes, and responsive layout"],[758,"**What happens with sprite mode:**"],[337,"##"],[1589,"## Fe"],[244,"## Features\n\n- **Single and mult"],[245,"## Features\n\n- **Single and multi-series support**: Display one or multiple data series wit"],[249,"## Features\n\n- **Single and multi-series support**: Display one or multiple data series wit"],[247,"## Features\n\n- **Single and multi-series support**: Display one or multiple data series with grouped bars\n- **Vertical and hori"],[1295,"## Features\n\n- Components adapt to the space they are given with intrinsic CSS a"],[1590,"## Features\n\n- Six coordinated sizes, from a `2xl` page title down to"],[302,"## Installation\n\n```bas"],[338,"## Installation\n\n```bash"],[339,"## Installation\n\n```bash\nnpm"],[607,"## Installation\n\n```bash\nnpm install --save @godaddy"],[172,"`@godaddy/antares/date` re-exports `@internationalized/date`, the package behind these date primitives."],[866,"`2xl` - 2x extra large spacing"],[642,"`acceptedFileTypes` is a best-effort filter for the OS picker — always validate file type and size again in your `onSelect` handler, since it can be bypassed."],[1209,"`aria-checked` indicates selection state"],[1330,"`aria-checked` indicates selection state"],[484,"`aria-describedby` wires the `helperText` to the progressbar for screen readers"],[396,"`aria-disabled` for disabled checkboxes"],[1210,"`aria-disabled` for disabled options"],[1331,"`aria-disabled` for disabled segments"],[398,"`aria-invalid` for validation errors"],[1212,"`aria-invalid` for validation errors"],[1662,"`aria-label` (or `aria-labelledby`) is required on the group container"],[1332,"`aria-label` required on the container for screen readers"],[483,"`aria-labelledby` associates the visible label when the `label` prop is provided"],[397,"`aria-required` when selection is required"],[1211,"`aria-required` when selection is required"],[481,"`aria-valuemin` and `aria-valuemax` define the range (default `0`–`100`)"],[480,"`aria-valuenow` is omitted while indeterminate; otherwise it reflects the current value (clamped to 0–100)"],[482,"`aria-valuetext` and visible value text are omitted while indeterminate; otherwise `aria-valuetext` provides a formatted string (e.g. `\"60%\"`) via `Intl.NumberFormat`; the same string is rendered inside the circle. Override the text with the `aria-valuetext` prop, or control formatting with `formatOptions`"],[858,"`Box` is a polymorphic layout component that renders as any HTML element or custom component via the `as` prop. It provides consistent spacing, elevation, rounding, and self-alignment within flex or grid containers."],[875,"`BoxContext` supplies default props to Boxes in its subtree. A `slots` map supplies defaults to\nnamed parts; each Box selects one with `slot`. Explicit consumer props override defaults, while\nclasses, styles, and refs are merged. Pass `slot={null}` to opt out of the context."],[521,"`Button slot=\"trigger\"` renders a native button with `aria-expanded` for its open state and\n`aria-controls` linked to the panel automatically."],[171,"`Calendar` values are `CalendarDate` objects. Import the date primitives you need from the `@godaddy/antares/date` subpath:"],[202,"`CardGroup` uses grid navigation: Tab enters or leaves, arrow keys move between Cards, and Space\nchanges selection. Enter activates row actions or links. Choose selection or `onAction`;\ncombining them prevents pointer selection."],[382,"`CheckboxGroup` is composed: write `Label`, a `Group` holding the `Checkbox` items, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. The `Group` takes its axis, gap, and presentational role from the group's `orientation`, so a bare `<Group>` is all you need; pass your own `direction`/`gap` to lay the items out differently. Each `Checkbox` takes label text next to the indicator."],[443,"`ChipButton` for menu filters and other actions with a 