ria-label` or `aria-labelledby`. For a labeled, popover-style picker, prefer `Select`."],[863,"`md` - Medium spacing"],[954,"`MenuTrigger` wraps a trigger element and a `Popover` containing `Menu`. The menu is fully keyboard-navigable, supports typeahead search, and handles open/close state automatically. The trigger applies `hideArrow` and card styling to all popovers, including nested submenus."],[169,"`minValue` / `maxValue` bounds and `isDateUnavailable` per-day disabling"],[1017,"`ModalTrigger` wraps a trigger button and a `<Modal>`, handling open state automatically. Based on RAC `DialogTrigger`."],[1157,"`orientation` switches between `horizontal` (accent bar on top) and `vertical` (accent bar on the leading edge)."],[1503,"`overflowLabels` is optional and defaults to \"Previous tabs\" and \"Next tabs\". Provide localized labels when needed; they should describe the logical direction rather than physical directions like \"left\" or \"right\", as the component automatically handles RTL layouts."],[1697,"`overlay` elevation panel positioned relative to its trigger, with an optional arrow"],[562,"`overlay=\"popover\"` always uses the desktop presentation."],[564,"`pageCount` sets months per popover page: one for single dates and two for ranges by default."],[1065,"`PaginationDots` is decorative and does not replace interactive page\ncontrols."],[826,"`placement` does not flip in RTL; the side is decided by document/flex order."],[814,"`placement` selects the collapse axis (`left`/`right` → width, `top`/`bottom` → height)"],[1082,"`PopoverTrigger` wraps a trigger button and a `<Popover>`, handling open state and positioning automatically.\nBased on RAC `DialogTrigger`. To anchor a popover to an element it doesn't wrap, pass `triggerRef` instead.\nA parent can set `hideArrow` and `containerProps` through `PopoverContext`. Props on `Popover` still win."],[817,"`prefers-reduced-motion` support"],[1110,"`Pressable` accepts the React Aria press props, including `onPress`, `onPressStart`, `onPressEnd`, `onPressUp`, and `onPressChange`."],[1115,"`Pressable` automatically applies React Aria state attributes such as `[data-hovered]`, `[data-pressed]`, `[data-focus-visible]`, and `[data-disabled]` to the child. Ensure the child component styles these states appropriately if it overrides the default `Pressable` styles."],[1198,"`RadioGroup` is composed: write `Label`, a `Group` holding the `Radio` items, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. The `Group` takes its axis, gap, and presentational role from the group's `orientation`, so a bare `<Group>` is all you need; pass your own `direction`/`gap` to lay the items out differently. Each `Radio` takes label text next to the indicator. `orientation` also sets keyboard-navigation direction and ARIA."],[1023,"`role=\"dialog\"` is applied automatically by the underlying React Aria `Dialog`"],[1087,"`role=\"dialog\"` is applied automatically by the underlying React Aria `Dialog`"],[589,"`role=\"dialog\"` with `aria-modal=\"true\"` on the drawer panel (via RAC Sheet)"],[740,"`role=\"img\"`: When title prop is provided"],[739,"`role=\"presentation\"`: For decorative icons"],[479,"`role=\"progressbar\"` on the container"],[1208,"`role=\"radio\"` on each option"],[1329,"`role=\"radio\"` on each segment"],[1207,"`role=\"radiogroup\"` on the container"],[1328,"`role=\"radiogroup\"` on the container"],[1661,"`selectionMode=\"multiple\"` → `role=\"toolbar\"` on container, `role=\"button\"` + `aria-pressed` per item"],[1660,"`selectionMode=\"single\"` → `role=\"radiogroup\"` on container, `role=\"radio\"` + `aria-checked` per item"],[566,"`shouldCloseOnSelect={false}` on the picker keeps the calendar open after selection."],[552,"`size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) applies to the field and calendar; omitted sizes follow the surrounding scope"],[1620,"`size` picks a step on the component's own ramp (`xs` to `2xl`) and changes only the font size."],[655,"`slot=\"title\"` inside a `Modal` or `Dialog` sets